# TabbyMcTabface contributor rules

- Read `CONTRIBUTING.md` and `docs/seam-catalog.md`.
- Preserve current-window scope and two-click confirmation for destructive UI actions.
- Return typed `Result<T, E>` values for expected domain/browser failures.
- Validate every runtime message and keep the manifest permission allow-list exact.
- Add executable behavior tests at the changed boundary. Keep shape-only contract
  examples in the separate contract-test tier.
- Never weaken artifact validation, compensation, or concurrency tests to make a
  failing implementation pass.
- Run `npm run typecheck`, `npm run lint`, relevant tests, and
  `npm run test:smoke` before handoff. Run `npm run verify` before release.
